---
interface Props {
  tone?: 'light' | 'dark';
}
const { tone = 'light' } = Astro.props;
const dark = tone === 'dark';
---
<section id="contact" class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 md:py-24">
  <div class={`rounded-[28px] p-7 md:p-14 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8 md:gap-10 ${dark ? 'bg-charcoal text-linen' : 'bg-card text-ink shadow-[0_16px_48px_rgba(42,37,34,0.08)]'}`}>
    <div class="flex-[1_1_360px] min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-3.5">
      <span class={`eyebrow ${dark ? 'text-gold' : ''}`}>
        <span data-lang="en">Contact Antoine</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Contacter Antoine</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Contactar a Antoine</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class={`font-display font-medium text-[32px] md:text-[46px] leading-[1.08] ${dark ? 'text-linen' : 'text-ink'}`}>
        <span data-lang="en">Tell me which city, how many of you, and roughly when</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Dites moi quelle ville, combien vous êtes, et à peu près quand</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Dime qué ciudad, cuántos sois y más o menos cuándo</span>
      </h2>
      <p class={`text-base leading-relaxed max-w-[52ch] ${dark ? 'text-linen/80' : 'text-ink-soft'}`}>
        <span data-lang="en">I will get back to you with times that work. If you're not sure which tour fits, just describe what you're after and I'll point you the right way.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Je reviendrai vers vous avec des horaires qui conviennent. Si vous ne savez pas quelle visite choisir, décrivez simplement ce que vous cherchez et je vous orienterai.</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Te responderé con horarios que funcionen. Si no estás seguro de qué tour te conviene, simplemente describe lo que buscas y te orientaré.</span>
      </p>
      <p class={`font-display italic text-xl ${dark ? 'text-linen' : 'text-ink'}`}>
        <span data-lang="en">Every booking goes straight through to me, personally.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Chaque réservation arrive directement jusqu'à moi, personnellement.</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Cada reserva llega directamente a mí, en persona.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-[1_1_300px] min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-3">
      <a href="https://wa.me/33626391783" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-whatsapp hover:bg-[#1a6f3f] text-white px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-base no-underline min-h-14 transition-colors">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-8.5 8.3 8.6 8.6 0 0 1-4-1L3 20l1.3-4.3A8.3 8.3 0 0 1 3.5 11.5 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 12 3.2a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9 8.3z"></path></svg>
          <span data-lang="en">Message on WhatsApp</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Message sur WhatsApp</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Mensaje por WhatsApp</span>
        </span>
        <span class="font-medium text-sm opacity-90 tabular-nums">+33 6 26 39 17 83</span>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:contact@savornstories.com" class={`flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-base no-underline min-h-14 border-[1.5px] transition-colors ${dark ? 'border-linen/60 text-linen hover:bg-linen hover:text-ink' : 'border-ink text-ink hover:bg-ink hover:text-linen'}`}>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"></path></svg>
          <span data-lang="en">Send an email</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Envoyer un email</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Enviar un email</span>
        </span>
        <span class="font-medium text-[13px] opacity-80 truncate">contact@savornstories.com</span>
      </a>
      <span class={`text-[13px] leading-relaxed ${dark ? 'text-linen/70' : 'text-ink-soft'}`}>
        <span data-lang="en">Answered personally, in English, French or Spanish.</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Réponse personnelle, en français, en anglais ou en espagnol.</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Respuesta personal, en español, inglés o francés.</span>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
